<title>JAPAN: Hagiwara Electric -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Hagiwara Electric -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 20.63		vs	   19.69</p>
<p> Operating	  618    million	  vs	  544    million</p>
<p> Current	    459    million	  vs	  420    million</p>
<p> Net		  261    million	  vs	  223    million</p>
<p> EPS		   46.49 yen	  vs	   55.44 yen</p>
<p> Shares		6 million	  vs	   4 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Hagiwawa Electric Co Ltd is a trading company dealing in machinery and electronic parts.</p>
